      "id": "notifications.change-events",
      "status": "implemented",
      "summary": "Every successful state-changing command pushes to each registered controller except the requester; the Table 5.22 observed triggers are wired from the fabric -- counters at one push per descriptor per second, AS_PATH (grandmaster identity changes plus a changed atomic publish of the staged PathTrace tail/count), and a GET_AVB_INFO trigger that snapshot-compares every field the root serves (grandmaster identity, the effective propagation delay, the gPTP domain number, asCapable), none of them conditioned on grandmaster presence, with the SR class-A priority and VLAN ID detected by the processor off the wires it publishes.",
